      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "The 'Hammer': A hand like 2-3-4-5-7 rainbow is the ultimate weapon in this game.",
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "If you have four cards to a wheel (2-3-4-5), but two are the same suit, your Badugi is technically only 3 cards (2-3-4). This is a 'Rough' hand; don't overplay it.",
